<title>ITALY: Fiat Jan car registrations up 1.09pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Fiat Jan car registrations up 1.09pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>New car registrations for the Italian car group Fiat rose 1.09 percent to 93,030 units in January 1997 compared with January 1996, the Italian Transport Ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>Fiat's January 1996 registrations totalled 92,022 units.</p>
<p>Earlier the Transport Ministry said total Italian January new car registrations stood at 207,000 in January, up 4.38 percent on January 1996.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
